    <string name="guide_content">• Tap + to add a new recipe\n• Long press a recipe card to drag and reorder\n• Double tap the dice to pick a random recipe\n• Open a recipe and tap the share icon in the top bar to turn it into one tall image you can share with others\n• Use Backup &amp; Restore in Settings to keep your recipes safe or move them to a new phone\n• Tap the category bar to switch categories\n• Long press a category to rename it\n\nFree version: up to %1$d recipes.\nA one-time purchase unlocks the full version with unlimited recipes. Everything is stored on your device, and backup is always free.</string>
